# After contact, continue into the 63.58 mm line segment at 10 mm/s. The first 0.10 s of line control uses 10 ms speedl holds, then line control switches to 1 ms holds.
# Aggressive normal Z correction targets signed Fz ~= -target_force_abs, where the bridge
# normally writes target_force_abs=5 N into input register 29.
